jyotish-headline-green = A favorable day — the currents are with you
jyotish-headline-yellow = A mixed day — act with awareness
jyotish-headline-red = A challenging day — keep it simple
jyotish-summary-green-panchanga-0 = The panchanga reads favorable — tithi, yoga, and karana support forward motion. This is a solid day for starts and signatures on the calendar alone. Act while the window is open; do not wait for a perfect mood.
jyotish-summary-green-panchanga-1 = Lunar-day factors lean positive without needing a birth chart. Steady effort compounds; small launches and follow-ups land cleanly. Schedule the important call or errand before the day fills up.
jyotish-summary-green-personal-0 = The currents favor you today — your birth Moon and the lunar day line up well. Momentum is available for decisions you have already prepared. Move on what matters, and leave busywork for a flatter day.
jyotish-summary-green-personal-1 = Personal markers support progress: tara and Moon house are working with you. Use the lift for conversations, commitments, and finishing open loops. Keep one clear priority so the energy does not scatter.
jyotish-summary-red-panchanga-0 = Panchanga flags a challenging stretch — tense yoga, empty tithi, or Vishti-style blocks may apply. Prefer completion and cleanup over beginnings. If something must start, keep it small and reversible.
jyotish-summary-red-panchanga-1 = The calendar alone advises caution: conditions are rough for new starts. Stick to known routines and postpone risk. Revisit big decisions when the score turns yellow or green.
jyotish-summary-red-personal-0 = Your birth markers make today heavier — friction shows up sooner than usual. Protect energy and skip optional conflict. Delay launches, large purchases, and hard conversations when you can.
jyotish-summary-red-personal-1 = Personal tara and Moon pressure ask for a quiet gear. The chart favors repair, rest, and simple duties over ambition. Say no early so the day does not drain you.
jyotish-summary-yellow-panchanga-0 = The day is neither clearly open nor closed — panchanga factors pull both ways. Routine and review work well; big leaps need extra caution. Confirm details twice before you commit.
jyotish-summary-yellow-panchanga-1 = A middling lunar day: useful for maintenance, weak for all-or-nothing moves. Keep momentum on existing work and avoid new contracts if you can wait. When in doubt, choose the reversible option.
jyotish-summary-yellow-personal-0 = Mixed signals from your chart: some support, some drag. Progress is possible if you choose scope carefully. Advance the safe half of the plan and park high-stakes bets.
jyotish-summary-yellow-personal-1 = Your natal layer and today's Moon do not fully agree — expect stop-and-go. Clarify, prepare, and double-check rather than force a breakthrough. One measured step beats three rushed ones.
jyotish-influence-calm = No strong pull either way — keep a steady pace and finish ordinary tasks
jyotish-influence-tara-janma = Janma tara (birth-star count): nerves run hot — rest the body, avoid overcommitting
jyotish-influence-tara-sampat = Sampat tara (wealth star): gains are favored — close deals and track money carefully
jyotish-influence-tara-vipat = Vipat tara (obstacle star): friction is likely — skip gambles and new commitments
jyotish-influence-tara-kshema = Kshema tara (safety star): protection is up — stabilize health, home, and basics
jyotish-influence-tara-pratyak = Pratyak tara (resistance star): plans meet pushback — postpone launches and hard sells
jyotish-influence-tara-sadhana = Sadhana tara (effort star): focused work pays — pick one goal and finish a chunk
jyotish-influence-tara-naidhana = Naidhana tara (drain star): energy leaks fast — cut optional load and recover
jyotish-influence-tara-mitra = Mitra tara (ally star): people help — ask for support and collaborate
jyotish-influence-tara-parama-mitra = Parama Mitra tara (best ally): strong backing — use goodwill for key asks
jyotish-influence-chandra-high = Moon in a strong house from your birth Moon — mood and timing support action
jyotish-influence-chandra-neutral = Moon in a neutral house today — neither a boost nor a block; stay practical
jyotish-influence-chandra-low = Moon in a low house (chandrashtama-style): mood dips — keep plans light
jyotish-influence-tithi-rikta = Rikta tithi (empty lunar day): poor for new starts — close loops instead
jyotish-influence-tithi-purna = Purna tithi (full lunar day): completion is favored — finish and deliver
jyotish-influence-tithi-flow = Lunar day supports steady progress — keep moving without forcing a leap
jyotish-influence-amavasya = Amavasya (New Moon): turn inward — rest, review, and avoid loud launches
jyotish-influence-purnima = Purnima (Full Moon): emotions peak — ship results, but watch overreaction
jyotish-influence-yoga-vyatipata = Vyatipata yoga: sudden reversals possible — confirm facts before you commit
jyotish-influence-yoga-vaidhriti = Vaidhriti yoga: friction and delays — pad schedules and lower expectations
jyotish-influence-yoga-tense = A tense yoga rules the day — slow down decisions and double-check details
jyotish-influence-vishti = Vishti karana (Bhadra): bad for beginnings — do not start anything important
jyotish-influence-karana-fixed = Fixed karana: better for routine than novelty — maintain, do not invent
